<title>BARBADOS: CRICKET-WEST INDIES 144-5 V INDIA - TEA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-WEST INDIES 144-5 V INDIA - TEA.</headline>
<dateline>BRIDGETOWN, Barbados 1997-03-27</dateline>
